<header><p class="st-kicker">tribal confederation · Italy</p><h1 class="st-title">Marrucini</h1><p class="st-meta">600 BCE – 304 BCE (approx.) · capital Teate</p></header>
<p class="st-teaser">Small Sabellic people on the Adriatic coast around Teate (Chieti), allies of Rome from 304 BCE and rebels in the Social War.</p>
<div class="st-body"><div class="st-text"><h2>Origins</h2><p>The Marrucini occupied a narrow strip between the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/aterno-pescara">Aterno</a> river and the Foro, inland of the Adriatic coast in modern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/abruzzo">Abruzzo</a>, with <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/chieti">Teate</a> as their main town. They were counted among the Sabellian peoples and spoke a dialect close to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/oscan-language">Oscan</a>.</p><h2>Rule and society</h2><p>Little is known of their organisation beyond a single community centred on <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/chieti">Teate</a>. A bronze inscription from Rapino, the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/tabula-rapinensis">Tabula Rapinensis</a>, records a sacred regulation in their dialect. Like their neighbours, they lived by farming and herding.</p><h2>Decline and legacy</h2><p>The Marrucini made an alliance with <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rome">Rome</a> in 304 BCE with the <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/marsi">Marsi</a> and <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/paeligni">Paeligni</a> and fought for Rome against <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hannibal">Hannibal</a>. In the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/social-war-91-87-bce">Social War</a> they joined the rebels; their commander <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/herius-asinius">Herius Asinius</a> was killed in 90 BCE. They gained citizenship afterwards, and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/chieti">Teate</a> became a Roman municipium.</p><p class="st-conf">Few sources survive for this state; details are uncertain.</p></div><aside class="st-side"><div class="st-emblem" role="img" aria-label="tribal confederation, 600 BCE – 304 BCE (approx.)"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="44" cy="56" rx="16" ry="24"/><path d="M44 34 V78"/><path d="M68 20 V84"/><path d="M68 20 L63 30 H73 Z"/></svg><p class="st-emblem-type">tribal confederation</p><p class="st-emblem-region">Italy</p><div class="st-span" aria-hidden="true"><span class="st-span-bar" style="left:47.76%;width:5.89%"></span></div><div class="st-span-axis" aria-hidden="true"><span>3000 BCE</span><span>1 CE</span><span>2000</span></div></div><dl class="st-facts"><dt>Years</dt><dd>600 BCE – 304 BCE (approx.)</dd><dt>Centuries</dt><dd><a href="/centuries/7th-century-bce">7th century BCE</a> – <a href="/centuries/4th-century-bce">4th century BCE</a></dd><dt>Type</dt><dd>tribal confederation</dd><dt>Character</dt><dd>tribal</dd><dt>Capital</dt><dd>Teate</dd><dt>Rulers</dt><dd>Herius Asinius</dd><dt>Religion</dt><dd>Sabellic polytheism</dd><dt>Language</dt><dd>Marrucinian (Oscan)</dd><dt>Today</dt><dd><a href="/countries/italy">Italy</a></dd></dl><figure class="st-locator"><a href="/atlas?year=-452&amp;focus=marrucini" aria-label="Marrucini on the atlas"><svg class="map map-loc" viewBox="5024 671 640 512" role="img" aria-label="Map: where Marrucini lay"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><path class="map-tie" d="M5344 927L5304 942"/><path class="map-dot-n" d="M5304 942h0"/><path class="map-dot-halo" d="M5344 927h0"/><path class="map-dot-me" d="M5344 927h0"/></svg></a><figcaption>The dot marks Teate. <a href="/atlas?year=-452&amp;focus=marrucini">On the atlas &rarr;</a></figcaption></figure></aside></div>

